]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"31603fdc","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.007331,"end_time":"2026-09-02T11:15:23.339705+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-02T11:15:23.332374+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["### Premium distribution"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":7,"id":"21c30727","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-09-02T11:15:23.356335Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-09-02T11:15:23.355933Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-09-02T11:15:23.867511Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-09-02T11:15:23.866639Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.522091,"end_time":"2026-09-02T11:15:23.869454+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-02T11:15:23.347363+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"data":{"image/png":"\n","text/plain":["<Figure size 1000x550 with 1 Axes>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"}],"source":["fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 5.5))\n","sns.histplot(model['Premium'], bins=55, kde=True, color='#2457C5', edgecolor='white', ax=ax)\n","ax.axvline(model['Premium'].median(), color='#273142', linestyle='--', label=f\"Median: ${model['Premium'].median():,.0f}\")\n","ax.set_title('Distribution of age-40 monthly premiums')\n","ax.set_xlabel('Gross monthly premium ($)')\n","ax.set_ylabel('Plan-rating-area observations')\n","ax.legend(frameon=False)\n","sns.despine()\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"96afcc6f","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.008752,"end_time":"2026-09-02T11:15:23.886753+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-02T11:15:23.878001+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["The distribution is strongly right-skewed. The median premium is **$692**, below the **$736** mean, while 90% of observations are below **$997**. A smaller group of high-cost plans stretches the distribution to **$3,051**, so medians are more representative than means for category comparisons.\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"ec89f49c","metadata":{"papermil